# Note on the console logs from the three drivers.
#
# results/*_console.log are NOT tracked -- the repository root .gitignore
# carries a blanket `*.log` rule and that convention is left alone here.
#
# Nothing is lost by it. results/*.json is the authoritative record and is what
# the report quotes: it holds every per-run value, the algorithm parameters and
# the shift vectors, in a form that can be re-read rather than re-parsed. The
# logs are only a prettier rendering of the same data and are regenerated by
# re-running the scripts.
#
# If the logs are ever wanted in the report appendix as evidence of running the
# experiments, one line here brings them back:
#     !results/*_console.log
